  self-contained. Momentum: a fines parcel leaves at its source velocity and merges inelastically
  at the destination, exactly as `wet_grain` merges absorbed-water momentum
  (`m_old·v + Σ take·ρ·v_src) / (m_old + Σ take·ρ)`). Symmetric roundoff floors on both lanes
  (the `wet_sat_cutoff` floor pattern) so the asymptotic tail can't leak one-signed.
